{"path":"utility/functional/is_placeholder","title":"std::is_placeholder","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>is_placeholder","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/functional/is_placeholder","section":"utility","kind":"page","summary":"If T is the type of a standard placeholder (_1, _2, _3, ...), then this template is derived from std::integral_constant<int, 1>, std::integral_constant<int, 2>, std::integral_constant<int, 3>, respectively.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/functional\">&lt;functional&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> is_placeholder<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>If <code>T</code> is the type of a standard placeholder <code>(_1, _2, _3, ...)</code>, then this template is derived from <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/integral_constant\"><span class=\"kw652\">std::<span class=\"me2\">integral_constant</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span>, <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/integral_constant\"><span class=\"kw652\">std::<span class=\"me2\">integral_constant</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span>, <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/integral_constant\"><span class=\"kw652\">std::<span class=\"me2\">integral_constant</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span>, respectively.\n</p><p>If <code>T</code> is not a standard placeholder type, this template is derived from <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/integral_constant\"><span class=\"kw652\">std::<span class=\"me2\">integral_constant</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span>.\n</p><p>A program may specialize this template for a <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/type#Program-defined_type\">program-defined type</a> <code>T</code> to implement <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/UnaryTypeTrait\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">UnaryTypeTrait</em></a> with base characteristic of <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/integral_constant\"><span class=\"kw652\">std::<span class=\"me2\">integral_constant</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span>, N<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span> with positive <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">N</span></code> to indicate that <code>T</code> should be treated as <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">N</span></code><sup>th</sup> placeholder type.\n</p><p><span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/bind\">std::bind</a></span> uses <code>std::is_placeholder</code> to detect placeholders for unbound arguments. \n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Helper_variable_template\">Helper variable template</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx17\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> is_placeholder_v <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> is_placeholder<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">value</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"t-inherited\">\n<h2 id=\"Inherited_from_std::integral_constant\">Inherited from <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/integral_constant\"> <span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>integral_constant</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"Member_constants\">Member constants</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span>value</span></span></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-cmark\">[static]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   placeholder value or <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">​<span class=\"nu0\">0</span>​</span></code> for non-placeholder types  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public static member constant)</span>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Member_functions\">Member functions</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator int</span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   converts the object to <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">int</span></span>, returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">value</span></code>  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator()</span></span></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx14\">(C++14)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">value</span></code>  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Member_types\">Member types</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td>  Type\n</td>\n<td>  Definition\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <code>value_type</code>\n</td>\n<td>  <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">int</span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <code>type</code>\n</td>\n<td>  <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/integral_constant\"><span class=\"kw652\">std::<span class=\"me2\">integral_constant</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span>, value<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;functional&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;type_traits&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> My_2 <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span> my_2<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">namespace</span> std\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> is_placeholder<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>My_2<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> <span class=\"kw1\">public</span> integral_constant<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> f<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> n1, <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> n2<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> n1 <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> n2<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1773\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Standard placeholder _5 is for the argument number \"</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">is_placeholder_v</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>decltype<span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">placeholders</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span>_5<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> b <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/bind\"><span class=\"kw1059\">std::<span class=\"me2\">bind</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>f, my_2, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1773\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Adding 2 to 11 selected with a custom placeholder gives \"</span> \n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> b<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">10</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">11</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"co1\">// the first argument, namely 10, is ignored</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>Standard placeholder _5 is for the argument number 5\nAdding 2 to 11 selected with a custom placeholder gives 13</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/bind\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>bind</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  binds one or more arguments to a function object <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/placeholders\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>_1, _2, _3, _4, ...</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  placeholders for the unbound arguments in a <code>std::bind</code> expression <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(constant)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Helper variable template","id":"Helper_variable_template"},{"depth":2,"text":"Inherited from std::integral_constant","id":"Inherited_from_std::integral_constant"},{"depth":3,"text":"Member constants","id":"Member_constants"},{"depth":3,"text":"Member functions","id":"Member_functions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Member types","id":"Member_types"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"utility","title":"Utility library"},{"path":"utility/functional","title":"Function objects"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::is_placeholder","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. If T is the type of a standard placeholder (_1, _2, _3, ...), then this template is derived from…"},{"label":"Helper variable template"},{"label":"Inherited from std::integral_constant","children